5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Let's get started! I'm curious about our talent pipeline and who's actually available to help our new companies grow.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,George,,I think we need to be more honest about our past performance and what actually drove our returns.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"I agree, but we also need to look at our liquidity and how we handle the money after the first check.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know why our reporting is such a headache! I'm looking into how we verify the numbers.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I'm concerned about the delays we've seen. I want to know what's actually stopping us from deploying.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@George, do you think the recruiter data would help your view on returns?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,George,,Not necessarily. I'm more interested in the actual customer retention and the nature of our exits.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Mizuki, if you find something about deployment, let us know. I'll be checking our credit options.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'll also check the audit process. It's always a nightmare at the end of the quarter.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,I'll look into the delivery records of our current holdings to see where the bottlenecks are.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'll stick with the recruiters and the adviser bench. We need to know who can actually step in.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,George,,I'll take the profile of exits and the account retention figures.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I'm adding reserve accounts to my list. We can't keep bleeding cash.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,pass,Rin,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I'll add the security review times to my list.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
