35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"It looks like we have plenty of software expertise on the board, but finding operational staff is a total nightmare.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,George,,"Interestingly, our successful exits were all back-office tools. The one we lost was an operation with physical premises.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,We're calling follow-on capital way faster than we planned. Our credit line is also very restrictive regarding software.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,I found out that hardware and depots make our audits way more expensive and slow. Software is easier to report.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,Security reviews for medical or financial data are taking forever. Hardware delivery is also a huge gamble.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@George, if the physical operations are the ones failing, maybe we should avoid companies with warehouses?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,George,,"That aligns with my findings. Also, the independent practice tools have much better retention than the shopkeeper tools.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Rin, if software is easier to report, that's a plus, but remember my point about the credit line.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@May, true, but the cost of outside appraisals for hardware is just too high for our current process.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Mio, the recruiter issue is real. We can't find field crews or supervisors quickly at all.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,So we need something that doesn't require a massive field crew and isn't a logistics nightmare.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,George,,And something with high retention. The medical and agricultural tools seem stable.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,But we need to be careful about how much capital they'll demand for equipment.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,I'm leaning away from anything that requires a physical depot or manual appraisal.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,And I'm wary of anything that takes nine months just to pass a security review.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
