60,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Okay, the candidates are Fabric Loop, Harvest Sensor, Ledger Bridge, and Clinic Scheduler. I'm leaning toward Ledger Bridge.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,George,,Fabric Loop has the depot risk. Harvest Sensor has the field crew risk. I like Clinic Scheduler or Ledger Bridge.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,May,,"Ledger Bridge is software, which helps the audit, but the credit line doesn't value those contracts.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Rin,,Fabric Loop and Harvest Sensor are out for me because of the appraisal and reporting headaches.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,Clinic Scheduler has that medical security review delay. Ledger Bridge is faster to deploy.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Mizuki, if Ledger Bridge is faster and doesn't need field crews, it's the safest bet for our resources.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,George,,Ledger Bridge is a financial tool. Our most profitable exits were back-office financial tools.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,May,,"It's true. Even if the credit line is tight, the lower capital intensity of software is better for our reserves.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Rin,,"I agree. No depots, no outside appraisals, and we can verify the numbers more easily.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,I'm sold on Ledger Bridge. It avoids the security bottlenecks of medical data and the hardware delays.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,I think we're all in agreement then.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,George,,I am.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,May,,Me too.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Rin,,Definitely.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
